RouteSpend OSM-derived geometry/topology database

This database is made available under the Open Database License 1.0
(ODbL 1.0):

https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Data © OpenStreetMap contributors.

OpenStreetMap attribution and copyright information:

https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

The ODbL applies to the database distributed in this package. Tariff prices,
origin/destination matrices, calendars, pricing rules, application code and
other RouteSpend business logic are not included in this package.
